import test from 'node:test';import assert from 'node:assert/strict';import {readFile} from 'node:fs/promises';import {fileURLToPath} from 'node:url';import {delayDopplerCoordinateView,describeDelayDoppler,delayDopplerProfile,inspectDelayDopplerFits} from './f15-radar.mts';import {member} from './common.mts';
const fixture=(name:string)=>fileURLToPath(new URL(`../../../../tests/fixtures/telescope-families/geographos-radar/${name}`,import.meta.url));
test('F15 keeps the authentic Geographos PDS3 delay-Doppler raster native',async()=>{const image=Buffer.from(await readFile(fixture('ge007.fit'))),label=Buffer.from(await readFile(fixture('ge007.lbl'))),native=inspectDelayDopplerFits(image);assert.deepEqual([native.height,native.width],[127,64]);assert.deepEqual(delayDopplerCoordinateView(native).shape,[127,64]);const profile=delayDopplerProfile(native,{delay:[0,2],doppler:[0,2]});assert.equal(profile.delay.length,2);assert.equal(profile.doppler.length,2);const product=describeDelayDoppler({id:'geographos-ge007',target:'1620-geographos',image:member('image','ge007.fit','science',image),label:member('label','ge007.lbl','label',label),bytes:image,labelBytes:label,producingRecord:'NASA PDS EAR-A-GST-3-RDR-GEOGRAPHOS-RADAR-V1.1'});assert.equal(product.components[0]?.axes[0]?.role,'doppler-index');assert.match(product.issues[0]?.reason??'',/no calibrated physical/i);assert.throws(()=>delayDopplerProfile(native,{delay:[0,65],doppler:[0,1]}),/in-bounds/);});
